      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_bf6abf0258aa257968b49809_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "To do so, set the __TRILIUM_PH_0__ __TRILIUM_PH_1__label__TRILIUM_PH_2__ to either:",
      "sourceHash": "bf6abf0258aa257968b498097a899b4273e12b68ba4a0bf462bdf40d59120d22",
      "context": "Frontend Events",
      "contextHash": "ba9fad0c895fd9f45953811b7e0cb7f49c36ba89b37af0e973fa780fc832a907",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_c8397ee29acbba0378eae33d_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__ - when Trilium frontend starts up (or is refreshed), but not on mobile.",
      "sourceHash": "c8397ee29acbba0378eae33d76cefd3ac73a601e1d89e35c00eb4fadaebae829",
      "context": "Frontend Events",
