      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__ - when Trilium frontend starts up (or is refreshed), on mobile.",
      "sourceHash": "ac76bde87f02b29c1b7a25c3cc1c5f8b8e5b58e54a5bceb535e03990ecf3c301",
